  {
   "id": "ex1",
   "type": "example",
   "problem": {
    "en": "A random variable X has p(x) = kx for x = 1, 2, 3, 4. Find k, P(X ≥ 3) and F(2)."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "Σp(x) = k(1 + 2 + 3 + 4) = 10k = 1 ⇒ k = 1/10."
    },
    {
     "en": "P(X ≥ 3) = p(3) + p(4) = 3/10 + 4/10 = 7/10."
    },
    {
     "en": "F(2) = P(X ≤ 2) = 1/10 + 2/10 = 3/10."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "k = 1/10, P(X ≥ 3) = 0.7, F(2) = 0.3"
   },
   "narration": {
    "en": "Let us work this out together. A random variable X has p(x) = kx for x = 1, 2, 3, 4. Find k, P(X ≥ 3) and F(2)."
   }
